    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWhite Strand House - one of Dungarvan's finest A-rated coastal properties!Directly opposite the Waterford Greenway overlooking White Strand Beach, the property has magnificent breathtaking views over Dungarvan Bay as far as Helvick Head! This pristine property was built in 2019 and is on its own private site at the front of Sallybrook on the highly sought after Clonea Road.Architecturally designed by Ailtire Architectural Services and built to the highest spec with concrete floor slabs and underfloor heating on the first floor, this is a rare opportunity to secure a forever home. To fully maximise the views on offer, the property has its main open plan kitchen/dining/living area on the upper floor with sliding glass doors to a south facing private veranda! This room has a designer kitchen with quartz counter tops and large centre island and the living area is divided by a stone clad freestanding chimney breast with fitted stove and media wall on the living side. Off the kitchen, there is a fully equipped utility room with a door to a clever rear external stairs to the garage. The master bedroom is also on the upper level with his & hers walk-in-wardrobes and stylish ensuite. The ground floor is also expansive (1,700 sq.ft approx.) with 4 double bedrooms all with walk-in-wardrobes with the main bedroom having an ensuite. The bathroom is off the hallway and is most impressively finished and has both bath and walk-in shower. At the end of the hall there is a feature living room with glass to all sides and sliding glass doors to another south facing patio area that opens to the enclosed, private lawned gardens.The property has a unique vantage point with uninterrupted views of Dungarvan Bay and the backdrop of the Comeragh Mountains to the rear. With local White Strand beach directly opposite and Clonea Blue Flag beach just up the Greenway - this property is a gem and the epitome of convenient coastal living. Externally, the property has a large detached garage joined by a convenient car port perfect for parking in bad weather. The property is surrounded by mature south facing lawned gardens secluded by mature hedges and impressive stone boundary walls.This is a unique opportunity to purchase a stunning coastal home in a most sought after location, a stroll from Dungarvan Harbour. Air to Water Heating. 291 sq.m (3,132 sq.ft) approx."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Stunning A-rated coastal residence.</li><li>Views over White Strand Beach & Dungarvan Bay.</li><li>Architecturally designed reverse level layout to maximise the views.</li><li>South facing elevated enclosed veranda.</li><li>Designer kitchen with quartz tops and island.</li><li>Master bedroom and open plan area on upper level.</li><li>Impressive detached garage with car port.</li><li>Walking distance to Dungarvan town centre.</li><li>Commuting distance to Cork and Waterford.</li><li>Short stroll to St Augustine's (The Friary) secondary school.</li><li>In cul de sac with extra communal parking opposite.</li><li>Prime location in one of Abbeyside's most sought after locations.</li><li>Direct access to Waterford Greenway at entrance. </li><li>Built in 2019.</li><li>Air to Water heating - underfloor on both floors.</li><li>Mains services.</ul>"
      },
